   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VDP301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13719 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VDP301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13719 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Explain fundamental video production principles and techniques by describing the stages of production (pre-production, production, and post-production) and the functions of key roles within a production crew.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Analyze the impact of scriptwriting, visual elements, and audio elements on storytelling by identifying key techniques in scripting, camera work, lighting, sound, and editing that enhance narrative flow and audience engagement.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Apply technical skills in operating video production equipment, including cameras, lighting systems, and audio devices, to capture high-quality footage.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Edit video and audio content proficiently using industry-standard software, focusing on continuity, pacing, transitions, and the integration of visual and sound effects to strengthen storytelling.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Use AI tools to enhance production efficiency and optimize workflow in tasks such as content planning, editing support, asset generation, and post-production enhancement.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Demonstrate effective teamwork and communication skills by collaborating within a production team, coordinating tasks, sharing responsibilities, and managing conflicts professionally.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Exhibit professional responsibility and ethical standards in video production by respecting copyright, privacy, and cultural sensitivity throughout all stages of content creation and distribution.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13719\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13719</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13719\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13719</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
